{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030111637808-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030143033\"/><p>男工被送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。</p><p>上水發生工業意外。今晨(30日)10時50分，清曉路一地盤職員報案，指一名男工在上址工作期間，遭鐵枝插傷下顎。救援人員接報到場，將涉事鐵枝切斷，受傷清醒的男工連同鐵枝，由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理，案件列作「工業意外一有人受傷」跟進，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>消息指，現場為房屋署轄下地盤，目前正進行地基工程，插有大量鋼筋。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:32.154815+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:16:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:20:20.111636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:40:46.334078+00:00","content_hash":"c670d1f5581b5468ed2cd211a2fe2be9c5d9d7165a811f63e2b6bed06af358e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:32.154815+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}